  "title": "wsug: explain UDP Multicast Streams dialog better",
  "description": "The \"empty speed\" settings and their goals needed to be clarified.\n\nThis dialog helps detecting when there is too much traffic from a\nclient perspective. In this context \"losses\" are related to buffer\noverrun, not starvation. The latter is better seen (yet) with the\nI/O Graph dialog.\n\nFixes #13837\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
